# Studio (`@umetrica/studio`)

## Patterns

- Pages in `src/pages/`, components in `src/components/`
- Data fetching: TanStack Query hooks in `src/hooks/`
- API clients in `src/lib/*-api.ts` with `credentials: 'include'`
- Set `Content-Type: application/json` only when request has `body`

## Cube

- Wrap analytics views in `CubeApiProvider`
- Token from `/api/cube/token`; proxy `/cubejs-api` in Vite

## Auth

- `authClient` with `organizationClient` + shared `orgRoles`
- baseURL via Vite proxy (`''`) — same origin as REST API
- Role checks: `useMe()`, `useCanWriteDashboards()` for viewer read-only UI
- Routes: `/verify-email`, `/forgot-password`, `/reset-password`, `/accept-invitation/:id`, `/onboarding`
- `OrgGate` redirects users without org to onboarding (except `/team` for invites)

## Vite

- `process.env` polyfill in `vite.config.ts` for react-grid-layout
- Direct deps required in pnpm (e.g. `react-resizable`)
